=================== p03_proliferation_mediator.py
P3b: REAL BIOLOGY THAT MOVES QC — young tissue proliferates (35% cycling), old does not (5%).
     Cycling cells carry more RNA (biology). metric = fraction of G2M-high cells / mean G2M score.

  content(G1,S,G2M)=(1.0, 1.4, 1.9)  metric=frac_cycling
  G0 PASS     expectation stable under all nuisance perturbations (no shift beyond estimator noise)
  G1 PASS     all 2 strata within 1.5x QC (worst 1.07x)
  G2 PASS     effect survives matching: 0.1283 -> 0.08733 (68% retained, subset balanced 1.01x)
  VERDICT: PASS — cleared 3 auto gates; treat as provisional until replicated

